WEBVTT

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:11.980
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.840
On the land with the frozen moonlight

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.670
It's rolling and drawing the line

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:40.880
The era of destruction and rebirth now begins

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:44.550
Heavily holding the freedom

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:48.120
Choosing the invisible path

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:55.230
Passing the sunset that's brighter than the daylight

00:00:55.230 --> 00:01:02.230
The vessel of time moves on as if telling the dream

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:11.340
There's a new dawn beyond the dark path

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:19.250
We may have been born from the arm of darkness

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:22.790
Just like being in an impossible love

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.760
We wander into the light

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:32.000
The path stretches indefinitely

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:37.490
And there's no way to go back

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:08.330
Shogunate Remnants Fleet

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:11.730
Flagship Kaiyomaru

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:16.310
Well, I'm sure that many of you are here,
as warriors and samurai,

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:20.870
having already determined your place to die!

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:29.220
However, I, Takeaki Enomoto,
am responsible for your lives!

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:32.020
With such responsibility,
I won't just let you die on your own!

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:36.760
Listen, this is no losing battle
where you go searching for your grave!

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.090
We fight to win!

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:41.960
We go there to seize victory!

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:46.370
What are we going to seize?

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:49.310
Where are we going?

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:51.100
That's what all of us want to know!

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:53.800
Show us our destination!

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:55.380
To the north...

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:57.680
I'm sorry, but that's all I can tell you right now.

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:01.480
I can't share this ship's final
destination with you just yet.

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:03.520
What do you mean by that?

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.290
But I promise you this!

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:09.360
I'll grant you life more meaningful than death!

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:12.060
I'll grant you hope rather than despair!

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:13.860
I promise you that!

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:20.730
Without waiting for the arrival of the Enomoto Fleet,
the war continues to spread north.

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:25.500
The Ouetsu Alliance totters on
the brink of destruction.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:32.080
The dragon of Hokuetsu, Tsuginosuke Kawai,
dies in battle en route to Aizu

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:35.280
shortly after the fleet leaves Shinagawa.

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.080
Ebisu...

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:36.610
You idiot...

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.980
<i>"THE MYSTERIOUS</i>
<i>TALE OF</i>
<i>THE GHOST-SEALING</i>
<i>MOONTEAR ASSASSIN"</i>

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:01.840
<i>"THE MYSTERIOUS</i>
<i>TALE OF</i>
<i>THE GHOST-SEALING</i>
<i>MOONTEAR ASSASSIN"</i>

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:08.000
In this revenge drama, the writer's true
objective is the Head of the Conqueror.

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:10.840
As is yours.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:15.650
Seal the Head... I have no other objective.

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:19.780
I need it for the sake of Japan.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:24.990
I won't let anyone take it. I'll seal it away
with my own hands. That's all.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:30.970
I suppose that's your mission
as the Eternal Assassin.

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:50.350
Everything has transpired
exactly as that man has written.

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:55.360
He used Yojiro, the
Eternal Assassin, as a catalyst

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:59.800
and managed to bring the
Head of the Conqueror to Enomoto...

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:04.670
He must be blaming himself...

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.370
Yojiro...

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:08.840
Probably.

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:10.740
But...

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:17.050
This could've made it very clear
who Yojiro's enemy is.

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:21.310
Possibly. It's getting chilly.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.850
Why don't we have hotpot tonight?

00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:25.980
Let me get it started then.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.920
Oh, this is a poison mushroom.

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:31.930
It's certainly hard to tell.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:39.730
So you failed.

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.170
Is that what you mean?

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:44.330
Yes.

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.640
And now Enomoto is possessed by the Head.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:47.610
Yes.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:51.080
Kill him, then.

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:56.950
Don't do it!

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:00.190
You're no amateurs; you could tell
that I intentionally missed.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.230
And another thing.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:09.390
You simply obeyed orders as soldiers;
I'm not going to condemn you for that.

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:17.740
But the man who gave the order
is a different matter altogether!

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:21.680
You were going to send the Head to
the bottom of the sea if you couldn't get it.

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:23.010
Why?

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:25.810
Answer me, Parkes!

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:28.080
Why did you try to sink me with it?

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:29.440
Answer me!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:46.140
Sakyonosuke Kanna, just who the hell are you?

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:53.600
Which do you trust; England or Japan?
Which is it?

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:41.460
There's no need for me to care about some
lout with no country to love and honor.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:45.620
I'm the one who gave the order.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:51.400
And the one who gave me the order
was Her Majesty, our Queen.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:55.370
You point your gun at the Queen right now.

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:59.400
You do realize that, don't you,
Sakyonosuke Kanna?

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.440
Swear your alliegiance once again.

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:10.420
Swear that you live in service to
Her Majesty and the British Empire!

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:16.860
Do so, and it'll become clear who your enemy is.

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:20.230
Things will go easier for you, Kanna.

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:35.470
Residence of Kaishu Katsu in Akasaka

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:35.450
Closing down the business?

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:40.240
Yes. So I came here today to say goodbye.

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:46.490
I see. So you're going north?

00:09:48.890 --> 00:09:50.920
I figured that much.

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:54.960
I wish I had more freedom, too.

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:58.940
But Tayu...

00:09:58.940 --> 00:09:59.930
Yes?

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:01.570
That man...

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:05.640
That man is no good. He's dangerous.

00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:07.410
What?

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:09.900
Oops, I just sounded jealous, didn't I?

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:12.720
Just be careful out there.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:34.470
Well, what should we do now?

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:36.700
Do you have any ideas?

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:41.300
Nope. I guess I could live a free
and easy life like I used to.

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:45.540
So what are you going to do?

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:50.110
Who knows...

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:53.020
Leader!

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:01.700
Thank you for waiting, everyone.

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:14.200
So easy!

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:23.900
30 seconds left.

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:27.750
Rook!

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:28.580
Okay!

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:51.700
Just 5 minutes. You passed.

00:12:56.310 --> 00:13:01.090
He seems good. The question remains, though...
how useful is he in the battlefield?

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:04.020
I have no opinion on him.

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:05.990
I don't think he's totally useless.

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:09.390
Oh well, I just follow orders.

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:11.990
We are soldiers, after all!

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:17.460
I wonder if we can handle this...

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:23.130
Since the olden days, a cat that catches
many mice is considered a good cat,

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:26.730
but a soldier who kills many enemies
doesn't even receive a medal.

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:29.710
We're all the same.

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:32.450
That's why we were chosen for this team.

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:35.290
Him too?

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:37.980
Unlike us, he's a civilian.

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:40.780
Let's see what he's got.

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:42.460
That goes for all of us.

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:53.000
These last ten years, everyone's worked so hard.

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:56.170
Without all of you, I would've been...

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:59.310
So I thank you so much.

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:00.610
Leader...

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:06.720
If I said it's been fun, I'm sure
Ebisu in Heaven would be upset with me,

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:08.740
but I've enjoyed every bit of it.

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:18.100
I have nothing more to say.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:20.360
Please take care, everyone.

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:22.990
Leader, where are you going?

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.260
I am...

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:29.170
I guess you weren't aware of your own feelings.

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:34.930
Well... I have...

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:38.910
I have something I want to clarify.

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:41.820
Leader!

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:43.880
Don't be lame.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:45.390
Tayu...

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:49.830
Stop asking lame questions, because
you already know whom she wants to follow.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:58.570
No... No way! No way!

00:14:58.570 --> 00:14:59.730
No way!

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:03.810
We'll meet again. Someday, somewhere.

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:08.070
Whoa, wait, wait, wait!
Don't tell me, Tayu, you, too?!

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:18.150
I knew it! Yes, I knew it, but still!

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:42.610
Leader! Leader!

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:44.780
Leader!

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:46.650
Go back, you two.

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:53.620
Please... Let me be alone.
Please don't follow me.

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:57.920
But you're going to follow
Samurai-san, aren't you?

00:15:59.300 --> 00:16:00.730
That's...

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:25.690
Never mind...

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:26.490
What?

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:27.590
Let's go back.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.680
Why? I don't wanna!

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:32.200
Don't be lame!

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:33.600
What's "lame"?

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:35.670
I don't know!

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:37.130
What's "lame"?

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:38.030
Shut up!

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:40.340
What's your problem?

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:41.340
Just forget it!

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:43.270
What does it mean?

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:45.670
Oh?

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:49.580
Leader...

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:00.590
What is this about?

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:05.190
Sotetsu Ibaragi, you're nothing but a writer,
so what are you plotting?

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:10.100
What kind of story did you use to trick Enomoto?

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:13.530
Answer me!

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:19.180
He shouldn't fight this war intent only to die in it.
That's all I told him.

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:21.080
Then why?

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:24.250
You may have abandoned your
native France and deserted her army,

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:27.310
but you still believe in the spirit of your country.

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.410
I feel the same way.

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:32.890
Oh really now?

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:39.760
The Tokugawa have been defeated,
but Enomoto is just getting started.

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:44.030
It looks we're both looking at the same thing...
something beyond him!

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:46.500
There's only one thing I desire.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:51.370
A true country, one among
the finest in the world. That's all.

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:54.670
What you want is revolution!

00:17:55.180 --> 00:17:56.870
That's also what I desire.

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:38.880
Off the coast of Shinagawa, a French Naval Supply Vessel

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:20.390
Hello.

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:38.640
All hands, full speed ahead!

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:41.820
Course: 0, north! Set sail!

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:50.460
Don't you move or you'll die, Captain!

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:12.210
From now on this ship is under our control!

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:21.430
However, under Monsieur Brunet's orders,

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:25.060
your mission to re-supply the
Enomoto Fleet remains the same.

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:25.930
Set sail!

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:41.180
See ya.

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:43.940
Where do you think you're going?

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:47.080
I'll decide when I get there!

00:20:47.690 --> 00:20:51.680
It sounds like you. Well, good luck to you.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.080
Everyone!

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:57.220
We got a letter!

00:20:57.930 --> 00:20:59.730
It's from the Master!

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:07.140
The Flames of War were spreading north...

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:12.880
With the fate of men, women and this very country...

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:15.070
To the distant north...

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:02.460
<i>TO THE NORTH</i>

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:09.330
The hand is the sword of love

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:18.370
It proves the beginning of all

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Beyond the sparkling sky

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
The dream is still an illusion

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Running on the path

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
Just like chasing the shadow of the moonlight

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:47.840
The torn sword of love

00:22:47.840 --> 00:23:00.080
At the end of it thousands of teardrops become one

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:05.890
And brighten tomorrow

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.600
This hand is the sword of love

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:20.300
It proves the beginning of all

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:47.900
EPISODE 15
THE
SECRET SWORD
RESONATES

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:40.190
Is that true? Great Lord Ieyasu Tokugawa
was an Eternal Assassin?!

00:23:40.260 --> 00:23:45.730
Then the Siege of Osaka and the Battle of
Sekigahara after that was all to seal the Head?

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:48.770
Yojiro is confirming that for me right now.

00:23:47.900 --> 00:24:02.570
THE
SECRET SWORD
RESONATES

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:51.270
Leader, what is that sword?

00:23:51.270 --> 00:23:54.040
I was called upon... by this sword.

00:23:54.040 --> 00:23:56.610
That's a Moontear Sword!

00:23:56.770 --> 00:24:01.510
Akizuki-sama, I'd like to walk
the same path with you.
